    "body": "Thanks!\r\n\r\nIn that case I think it's reasonable to send a spec PR to update both inputmode and enterkeyhint to reference \"editing hosts\" instead of \"elements in an editing host\". This should be a relatively easy change, in part because I can't think of a way to write web platform tests for this, so it's just a matter of updating the spec.\r\n\r\nWe can leave the question of potentially harmonizing autocapitalize for a future issue.",
